---
system: sys-04-realtime-session-orchestrator
flow_id: observer-attach
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/04-realtime-session-orchestrator#observer-lane
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, RealtimeService, Redis]
apis:
  - WS wss://realtime/v1/observer/{session_id}
externals: []
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - session_not_found
  - session_terminated
  - not_authorized_observer
  - ws_handshake_failed
idempotency: WS connect is idempotent — re-attach replays current state snapshot; multi-subscriber (N parent devices may attach simultaneously)
retry: client-side reconnect with exponential backoff; server pushes full state snapshot on every reconnect
timeout: WS handshake 3s p99; server idle ping every 60s; idle timeout 5min
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant RealtimeService
    participant Redis

    ParentApp->>Gateway: WS upgrade GET wss://realtime/v1/observer/{session_id} and Authorization: Bearer token
    Gateway->>Gateway: JWT verify and rate-limit (sys-17)

    alt ws_handshake_failed
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 400 / 426 Upgrade Required
    else JWT invalid
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 401 ws_handshake_failed
    else JWT valid
        Gateway->>RealtimeService: WebSocket upgrade forward

        RealtimeService->>Redis: GET realtime_session:{session_id} {state, user_id, child_id, turn_count, start_at}
        alt session_not_found
            Redis-->>RealtimeService: nil
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: 404 session_not_found
        else session_terminated
            Redis-->>RealtimeService: {state: ENDED|TIMED_OUT|COST_CAPPED|PARENT_STOPPED|ABANDONED}
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: 410 session_terminated {end_reason}
        else not_authorized_observer
            Redis-->>RealtimeService: {user_id: other_user_id}
            Note over RealtimeService: token user_id != realtime_sessions.user_id — FK chain violation
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: 403 not_authorized_observer
        else authorized
            Redis-->>RealtimeService: {state, user_id, child_id, turn_count, start_at, current_phase}
            Note over RealtimeService: token user_id matches realtime_sessions.user_id — read access granted
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: 101 Switching Protocols
            %% Multi-subscriber: N parent devices may attach simultaneously (ADR-0006 D4+D7)
            RealtimeService->>Redis: SUBSCRIBE session:{session_id}:observer
            Redis-->>RealtimeService: subscribed

            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: observer_snapshot {current_state, turn_count, start_at, current_phase, child_id}

            Note over ParentApp,Redis: server pushes observer events as session progresses

            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: session.started {session_id, child_id, course_id, start_at}
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: turn.started {turn_id, turn_count, phase: listening}
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: turn.completed {turn_id, end_reason: success|fallback, phase: idle}
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: safety.halt {turn_id, halt_reason}
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: session.reconnecting {since}
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: session.resumed {resumed_at, turn_count}
            RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: session.end {end_reason: completed|timed_out|cost_capped|parent_stopped|abandoned_disconnect, summary_available: bool}

            Note over ParentApp: phone disconnect is invisible to conversation (ADR-0006 D7) — robot WS unaffected
            Note over ParentApp,RealtimeService: on phone reconnect, re-attach replays observer_snapshot from current state
            loop idle keepalive
                RealtimeService-->>ParentApp: PING every 60s
                ParentApp-->>RealtimeService: PONG
            end
        end
    end

    Note over ParentApp,Redis: WS handshake 3s p99 — idle timeout 5min — observer lane multi-subscriber, does not count toward unique-session index
    %% see also: docs/sequences/04-realtime/session-start-mobile.sequence.mmd
    %% see also: docs/sequences/04-realtime/ws-handshake.sequence.mmd (device WS — distinct lane)
